"""Only the terminology needed to enter each volume, in visible prose."""
from html import escape

CONTEXTS={
 'initialization':('先認識本冊的三個暫存器：CAP（Controller Capabilities）描述控制器能力，CC（Controller Configuration）保存軟體選定的工作配置，CSTS（Controller Status）回報目前狀態。以下沿軟體設定與控制器回應，說明啟用及停用。','CAP (Controller Capabilities) describes controller capabilities; CC (Controller Configuration) holds the software-selected configuration; CSTS (Controller Status) reports state. Follow software writes and controller responses through enable and disable.'),
 'queues':('SQ（Submission Queue，提交佇列）放置命令，CQ（Completion Queue，完成佇列）放置處理結果。Host 是準備並提交工作的主機端；controller 是接收並處理命令的控制器。以下先連起一條 SQ 與它使用的 CQ，再處理建立和回收。','An SQ (Submission Queue) holds commands; a CQ (Completion Queue) holds their completion entries. The host prepares and submits work, and the controller processes it. Start with an SQ and its associated CQ before creation and reclamation.'),
 'doorbells':('Doorbell 是主機用來通知控制器佇列指標已更新的暫存器。SQ（Submission Queue）提交命令，CQ（Completion Queue）回報完成；CQE（Completion Queue Entry）是其中一筆完成項目。以下把指標繞回與 Phase Tag（辨識本輪完成項目的位元）放在同一輪操作中說明。','Doorbells notify the controller of updated queue pointers. SQs (Submission Queues) submit commands; CQs (Completion Queues) return CQEs (Completion Queue Entries). Follow wrap-around together with the phase tag that identifies the expected completion generation.'),
 'commands':('SQE（Submission Queue Entry，提交項目）保存一筆命令，CQE（Completion Queue Entry，完成項目）保存對應結果。CID（Command Identifier）識別同一提交佇列中尚未完成的命令；SQID（Submission Queue Identifier）指出是哪條提交佇列。以下沿一筆命令的生命週期讀這些欄位。','An SQE (Submission Queue Entry) carries a command, and a CQE (Completion Queue Entry) reports its result. CID (Command Identifier) distinguishes outstanding commands in one SQ; SQID (Submission Queue Identifier) identifies that SQ. Follow these fields through one command lifecycle.'),
 'identify':('Identify 是查詢物件能力與屬性的命令。CNS（Controller or Namespace Structure）選擇回覆結構，NSID（Namespace Identifier）識別 namespace；需要命令集專屬資料時，還會用到 CSI（Command Set Identifier）。namespace 是可由命令指定的邏輯儲存空間。','Identify queries object capabilities and attributes. CNS (Controller or Namespace Structure) selects the response structure, NSID (Namespace Identifier) identifies a namespace, and CSI (Command Set Identifier) selects a command set where applicable. A namespace is a command-addressable logical storage space.'),
 'features':('Feature 是可查詢或設定的功能項目；FID（Feature Identifier）選哪一項，SEL（Select）決定要讀目前值、預設值、保存值或支援能力。CQE（Completion Queue Entry）是完成項目，DW0（Dword 0）是其中第一個四位元組欄位；它的意義要連同本次查詢一起讀。','A feature is an individually selectable setting or capability. FID (Feature Identifier) selects it; SEL (Select) chooses the current, default, saved or supported-capability response. CQE (Completion Queue Entry) DW0 (Dword 0) is interpreted using that request context.'),
 'logs':('Get Log Page 讀取指定種類的狀態或紀錄。LID（Log Page Identifier）選紀錄頁，LPO（Log Page Offset）指定讀取位置；RAE（Retain Asynchronous Event）影響相應事件的保留或確認。以下先選資料與範圍，再說明分段及一致性。','Get Log Page retrieves a selected kind of state or record. LID (Log Page Identifier) selects the log, LPO (Log Page Offset) selects the retrieval position, and RAE (Retain Asynchronous Event) controls applicable event retention or acknowledgment. Establish the view and scope before pagination and consistency.'),
 'asynchronous-events':('本冊的 AER 是 Asynchronous Event Request，也就是先提交、等待事件時才完成的非同步事件請求。事件回覆提供種類與相關 LID（Log Page Identifier，紀錄頁識別值），主機再讀該紀錄取得細節，並依事件規則確認通知。','Here AER means Asynchronous Event Request: a preposted request completed when an event is reported. Its response identifies the event and relevant LID (Log Page Identifier); the host retrieves the details and acknowledges under that event’s rules.'),
 'errors':('先用 SQID（Submission Queue Identifier）與 CID（Command Identifier）找回原命令，再讀 CQE（Completion Queue Entry，完成項目）的狀態。SCT（Status Code Type）選狀態類別，SC（Status Code）給該類別中的代碼；補充紀錄再依命令身分與時間對照。','Use SQID (Submission Queue Identifier) and CID (Command Identifier) to recover the command before decoding CQE (Completion Queue Entry) status. SCT (Status Code Type) selects the category, and SC (Status Code) selects its code. Correlate supplemental records using command identity and timing.'),
 'recovery':('Abort 是要求中止指定命令的 Admin 命令；其本身與目標命令各有完成結果。CQE（Completion Queue Entry）提供命令完成資訊，CSTS（Controller Status）提供控制器狀態。以下先定位等待發生在哪個層次，再選擇適用的復原範圍。','Abort is an Admin command requesting termination of another command; the two commands have separate completions. CQEs (Completion Queue Entries) report command results, while CSTS (Controller Status) reports controller state. Locate the stalled layer before selecting recovery scope.'),
 'format-sanitize':('Format NVM 處理指定範圍的格式；Sanitize 與 Sanitize Namespace 各有自己的操作及影響範圍。SANICAP（Sanitize Capabilities）描述清除方法能力，LID（Log Page Identifier）則選擇用來觀察進度與結果的紀錄頁。先確認需求，再沿查詢與操作流程往下讀。','Format NVM, Sanitize and Sanitize Namespace have distinct operations and scopes. SANICAP (Sanitize Capabilities) describes sanitization-method capabilities; LID (Log Page Identifier) selects a progress or result log. Establish the intended operation and target before proceeding.'),
 'firmware-boot':('Firmware Image Download 傳送韌體映像，Firmware Commit 決定後續處理與啟用動作。FR（Firmware Revision）提供目前版本，FRMW（Firmware Updates）描述更新能力，AFI（Active Firmware Info）用來讀取韌體槽位資訊。以下將映像存在、排定啟用與實際執行版本接起來。','Firmware Image Download transfers an image, and Firmware Commit selects its processing or activation action. FR (Firmware Revision), FRMW (Firmware Updates) and AFI (Active Firmware Info) connect running revision, update capability and slot state. Follow image storage, scheduled activation and actual execution separately.'),
 'self-test':('Device Self-test 是裝置自我測試機制。STC（Self-test Code）選擇操作，DSTO（Device Self-test Options）描述相關能力；主機再由 Device Self-test Log 觀察目前工作與結果。命令被接受與測試結束各有觀察位置。','Device Self-test runs a device-defined diagnostic operation. STC (Self-test Code) selects the operation, DSTO (Device Self-test Options) describes its capabilities, and the Device Self-test Log reports progress and results. Command acceptance and test completion have distinct observations.'),
 'namespace-management':('namespace 是可由命令指定的邏輯儲存空間，NSID（Namespace Identifier）是存取時使用的識別值。Namespace Management 處理建立與刪除，Namespace Attachment 處理和控制器的附接關係。以下沿物件存在、附接與可存取條件來看各份清單。','A namespace is a command-addressable logical storage space identified by an NSID (Namespace Identifier). Namespace Management creates or deletes it; Namespace Attachment changes controller attachment. Connect existence, attachment and accessibility through the relevant lists.'),
 'reset-shutdown':('Shutdown 是有管理的停止流程，Reset 則依觸發方式影響對應狀態。CC（Controller Configuration）是主機的配置入口，CSTS（Controller Status）是觀察控制器狀態的入口；先分清本次事件，再讀設定、命令與資料的保留規則。','Shutdown is a managed stopping process; reset effects depend on the trigger. CC (Controller Configuration) provides the host configuration interface, and CSTS (Controller Status) reports controller state. Identify the event before interpreting retention of settings, commands and data.'),
 'health':('電源狀態描述子提供狀態類型及進出延遲；APST（Autonomous Power State Transition）配置自動電源轉換。SMART／Health Information Log 則回報健康與警告欄位。以下依問題選狀態、門檻或紀錄，保留各自單位。','Power-state descriptors identify state type and transition latencies; APST (Autonomous Power State Transition) configures automatic transitions. The SMART/Health Information Log reports health and warning fields. Select states, thresholds or records according to the question and retain their units.'),
 'persistent-events':('PEL（Persistent Event Log，持續事件紀錄）保存受支援種類的歷史事件。LID（Log Page Identifier）選該紀錄頁，讀取 context 用來協調一次讀取所觀察的內容。以下把事件成立、是否記錄與如何取得同一份資料接起來。','PEL (Persistent Event Log) retains supported kinds of historical events. LID (Log Page Identifier) selects the log, while a retrieval context coordinates the observed record set. Connect event conditions, logging and consistent retrieval.'),
 'keep-alive':('Keep Alive 機制以命令與時間條件協助觀察連線生命週期。KATO（Keep Alive Timeout）提供逾時設定，KAS（Keep Alive Support）描述支援粒度。先確認本次配置是否適用，再沿計時、重設與命令處理說明行為。','Keep Alive combines commands and timing rules to track a connection lifetime. KATO (Keep Alive Timeout) provides timeout configuration, and KAS (Keep Alive Support) describes the supported granularity. Establish applicability before following timers, reset and command handling.'),
 'memory':('HMB（Host Memory Buffer）使用主機提供的記憶體；CMB（Controller Memory Buffer）與 PMR（Persistent Memory Region）則有各自的控制器端區域與存取規則。以下先定位記憶體由誰提供、誰能存取，再看啟用、同步與生命週期。','HMB (Host Memory Buffer) uses memory provided by the host. CMB (Controller Memory Buffer) and PMR (Persistent Memory Region) expose controller-side regions with their own rules. Establish ownership and access before enable, synchronization and lifetime.'),
 'security':('Security Send／Receive 傳送安全協定資料；Command and Feature Lockdown 管理特定命令及功能的禁止條件。FID（Feature Identifier）識別功能，LID（Log Page Identifier）選擇相關能力或狀態紀錄。先辨認本次使用的機制，再讀其範圍與控制。','Security Send/Receive transfer security-protocol data; Command and Feature Lockdown controls prohibitions on selected commands and features. FID (Feature Identifier) selects a feature, and LID (Log Page Identifier) selects the associated capability or state log. Identify the mechanism before scope and control.'),
 'virtualization':('本冊區分 NVM subsystem、controller 與 namespace，再觀察多控制器及資源配置。CNTLID（Controller Identifier）識別控制器，NSID（Namespace Identifier）識別邏輯儲存空間；同一查詢需要連同目標控制器與當時配置保存。','Distinguish the NVM subsystem, controllers and namespaces before multi-controller resource management. CNTLID (Controller Identifier) identifies a controller; NSID (Namespace Identifier) identifies a namespace. Retain the target controller and configuration with each observation.'),
 'capacity':('NVM Set、Endurance Group 與 Domain 用來描述不同的資源與管理範圍。NVMSETID、ENDGID 與 DOMID 分別識別這些物件；namespace 則是命令可存取的邏輯儲存空間。以下依識別值查關係，再讀容量、配置與回收條件。','NVM Sets, Endurance Groups and Domains describe distinct resource or management scopes, identified by NVMSETID, ENDGID and DOMID. A namespace is a command-addressable logical storage space. Follow the identifiers into relationships, capacity and reclamation conditions.'),
 'media':('本冊先定位 Domain、Endurance Group 與 Media Unit，再讀可查詢的資源資訊及管理操作。DOMID（Domain Identifier）與 ENDGID（Endurance Group Identifier）用來選目標；回覆內容仍依本次命令與結構的有效條件判讀。','Locate the Domain, Endurance Group and Media Unit before querying resource information or management operations. DOMID (Domain Identifier) and ENDGID (Endurance Group Identifier) select objects; response validity remains command- and structure-specific.'),
 'pointers':('PRP（Physical Region Page）用頁面位置描述資料緩衝區，SGL（Scatter Gather List）以描述子表達位址、長度與類型。DPTR（Data Pointer）是命令的資料指標區。以下從傳輸範圍選對指標格式，再走到每段記憶體。','PRPs (Physical Region Pages) describe buffer pages; SGLs (Scatter Gather Lists) use descriptors with addresses, lengths and types. DPTR (Data Pointer) is the command’s pointer area. Start with the transfer range and pointer format, then follow the memory segments.'),
 'interrupts':('CQE（Completion Queue Entry）回報命令結果；中斷通知主機有工作可處理。MSI／MSI-X（Message Signaled Interrupts）是 PCIe 的訊息式中斷機制，NVMe 再以佇列與向量設定接上通知路徑。以下分別追蹤完成資料與通知條件。','CQEs (Completion Queue Entries) report command results; interrupts notify the host of work to process. PCIe MSI/MSI-X (Message Signaled Interrupts) connect through NVMe queue and vector configuration. Follow completion data and notification conditions separately.'),
 'integration':('本冊把已教過的查詢、命令、事件及重設放回同一情境。先保存原請求、目標及時間，再對照能力、配置、回覆與實際觀察。SQE／CQE 分別是提交與完成項目；需要欄位原理時，就近連回前冊。','Combine previously taught queries, commands, events and resets within one scenario. Preserve requests, targets and timestamps before correlating capability, configuration, responses and observations. SQEs and CQEs are submission and completion entries; links return to their earlier field explanations.'),
 'data-io':('LBA（Logical Block Address）選邏輯區塊，NLB（Number of Logical Blocks）依命令定義表示傳輸數量。FUA（Force Unit Access）與 Flush 涉及資料持久性，原子性則處理一筆寫入的更新保證。以下沿一筆資料 I/O 分別確認範圍、完成條件與資料結果。','LBA (Logical Block Address) selects a logical block, and NLB (Number of Logical Blocks) encodes the transfer count under the command’s rules. FUA (Force Unit Access) and Flush concern persistence; atomicity concerns update guarantees. Follow range, completion conditions and resulting data for one I/O.')
}

def volume_context(slug,language):
    return '<aside class="st-context"><p>'+escape(CONTEXTS[slug][0 if language=='zh' else 1])+'</p></aside>'
